comments.body:
Because it is used only on:

```
    if (manual_connection) {
        LogInfo("%s", error_message);
    } else {
        LogDebug(BCLog::NET, "%s", error_message);
    }
```

Setting it to false makes it log as debug, otherwise it would still log "connect() to 127.0.0.1:9051 failed after wait: Connection refused (111)"

